WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.380
to hunt for oil, but we don't have to do much hunting because we have the most oil of any

00:05.380 --> 00:08.960
nation anywhere, oil and gas in the world.

00:08.960 --> 00:13.800
And if you add coal, we have the most of any nation in the world.

00:13.800 --> 00:15.520
Clean — I call it clean, beautiful coal.

00:15.520 --> 00:20.440
You can do things today with coal that you couldn't have done 10 years ago, 15 years.

00:20.440 --> 00:23.280
So I have a little standing order in the White House.

00:23.280 --> 00:28.120
Never use the word coal, only use the words clean, beautiful coal.

00:28.120 --> 00:30.040
Sounds much better, doesn't it?

00:30.040 --> 00:34.500
But we stand ready to provide any country with abundant, affordable energy supplies if you

00:34.500 --> 00:35.880
need them, when most of you do.

